'''Nyanko Rangers''' (にゃんこレンジャー ''Nyanko Renjā'') are a group of [[Cat Units]] introduced in the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]]. Each Nyanko Ranger except for [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Rex]] has a [[Cat Combo]] that only affects Nyanko Rangers. 

The list of Ranger Cats includes:
*[[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Scarf Cat]] → Red Nyanko Ranger
*[[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Fedora Cat]] → Blue Nyanko Ranger
*[[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Helmet Cat]] → Yellow Nyanko Ranger
*[[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Goggles Cat]] → Green Nyanko Ranger
*[[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Ribbon Cat]] → Pink Nyanko Ranger
*[[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Rex]] → Giga-Nyan Prime DX
*[[Barista Cat (Special Cat)|Barista Cat]] → Silver Nyanko Ranger
*[[Commander Cat (Special Cat)|Commander Cat]] → Gold Nyanko Ranger

