==Trivia==
*Despite [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Ribbon Cat]]'s Japanese description claiming she is the only female Nyanko Ranger (紅一点 ''kōitten'' means the only female member of a group), [[Commander Cat (Special Cat)|Commander Cat]]'s Japanese description contains the word 才色兼備 ''saishokukenbi'', meaning a woman who is both intelligent and beautiful.
*In their Evolved Forms, each Special Nyanko Ranger's Japanese description mentions what kind of soul they have and the name of their signature weapon.
**[[Barista Cat (Special Cat)|Silver Nyanko Ranger]] and Gold Nyanko Ranger channel the souls of canids (tanuki and fox, respectively), whereas the rest channel felids' souls. This may be because Silver Nyanko Ranger and Gold Nyanko Ranger start as the enemies [[Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger]], and many other enemies are dogs.

